# Go build artifacts (module has no cmd/ dir; `go build ./...` drops binaries in the app dirs).
# Anchored to the exact artifact paths so the unanchored, case-insensitive (macOS)
# patterns do not also match the app source directories.
/apps/OpenComputerUseLinux/opencomputeruselinux
/apps/OpenComputerUseWindows/opencomputerusewindows
/apps/OpenComputerUseWindows/*.exe
/scripts/computer-use-cli/computer-use-cli
